## What ShareAlike means for this project

If you redistribute these models, or any model derived from them (including
meshes edited in Blender, decimated, re-textured, or split into sub-structures),
that derivative must also be released under CC BY-SA 2.1 Japan, with the
attribution above intact.

This applies to the 3D data only. The 3Dentes source code is MIT licensed and
carries no such obligation — see LICENSE.

Practically: anatomy authored from scratch in Phase 2 that does not incorporate
BodyParts3D geometry is a separate work and may be licensed however you choose.
Anatomy created by modifying BodyParts3D meshes is a derivative and inherits
ShareAlike. Keep the two clearly separated in the repo.
